@startuml Sequence Tracking
title Sequence Tracking Real-time (Pantau Lokasi Driver)
skinparam style strictuml

actor "User (Mitra)" as User
boundary "Halaman Tracking" as UI
control "ApiClient (Timer)" as API
control "Server Backend" as Server
entity "Database" as DB

autonumber

' --- Phase 1: Open Page ---
User -> UI: Buka Menu "Lacak Pesanan"
activate UI

UI -> API: Ambil Data Awal
activate API

API -> Server: Minta Info Lokasi Driver
activate Server

Server -> DB: Ambil Posisi Driver & Tujuan
activate DB
DB --> Server: Data Lokasi Ditemukan
deactivate DB

Server --> API: Respon: Lokasi Awal
deactivate Server

API --> UI: Tampilkan Peta & Marker
deactivate API

' --- Phase 2: Polling Loop (Live Tracking) ---
loop Setiap 10 Detik (Otomatis)
    UI -> API: Cek Posisi Driver Sekarang
    activate API
    
    API -> Server: Minta Update Lokasi
    activate Server
    
    Server -> DB: Di mana Driver Sekarang?
    activate DB
    DB --> Server: Koordinat Terbaru (Latitude, Longitude)
    deactivate DB
    
    Server --> API: Ini Posisi Terbarunya
    deactivate Server
    
    API -> UI: Geser Ikon Motor di Peta
    deactivate API
    
    UI --> User: Marker Bergerak (Animasi)
end

' --- Phase 3: Exit ---
User -> UI: Tekan Tombol Kembali / Keluar
destroy UI
UI -> API: Stop Pengecekan (Timer Stop)
note right: Hemat Baterai & Data

@enduml
